        <body>
            <div xml:id="d415">

                <pb facs="0778" n="668" sameAs="frus:frus1890/pg668"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Pratt to Mr. Blaine.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Teheran</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1890-06-14"><hi rendition="#italic">June</hi> 14, 1890</date>.
                        (Received July 21.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 462.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor herewith respectfully to
                    submit for your consideration the copy of a communication regarding the trial of
                    Mrs. Wright’s assassin which I have this day addressed to the British
                    consul-general at Tabreez, and which I trust will meet with your approval.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">E. Spencer Pratt.</hi></signed></closer>



                <xi:include href="d415-a1.xml" xpointer="d415-a1"/>
            </div>
